{
  "slug": "pagerduty",
  "name": "Pagerduty",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Enhance code quality and security through PagerDuty risk scoring and incident correlation. Score pre-commit diffs against historical incident data and surface deployment risk before you ship.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `create-pagerduty-skill` (Create or update PagerDuty skills for AI agents through guided interview), `pre-commit-risk-scoring` (Assess pre-commit risk by correlating PagerDuty incidents with current code changes)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `pagerduty`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pagerduty@claude-plugins-official` from `PagerDuty/claude-code-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
